ineers.\nM.S. in CHE Program\nThe Master of Science in Engineering program at Rowan University effectively prepares individuals to respond to the changing needs of engineers today.\nPh.D in CHE Program\nThe Ph.D. in Engineering Program at Rowan University effectively prepares individuals to respond to the changing needs of engineers today. Students will complete higher level coursework in technical topics and will develop and demonstrate applied skills in research, teaching, and communication leading to a terminal degree.\nChemical Engineering\nBack to Chemical Engineering (CHE)\nMain Menu\nChemical Engineering (CHE)\nMessage From The Dept Head\nAbout Us\nProgram Goals & Objectives\nContacts\nCampus Map & Directions\nIndustrial Advisory Board\nAccreditation\nFaculty & Staff\nUndergraduate Program\nB.S. in CHE\nCurriculum\nMinor in CHE\nBiological Engineering Concentration\nMaterials Concentration\nCUGS in Material Engineering\nSummer Courses\nGraduate Program\nM.S. Program\nPh.D. Program\nApplications & Admissions\nEngineering Clinics\nResearch\nCurrent Student Resources\nProspective Students\nTransfer Students\nWhy Rowan Chemical Engineering?\nNews\nDepartmental News\nCollege of Engineering News\nNew Faculty Openings\nRowan on LinkedIn\nRowan on Facebook\nRowan on Instagram\nRowan on YouTube\nRowan on Tiktok\nRowan University \u2022 201 Mullica Hill Road \u2022 Glassboro, New Jersey 08028 \u2022 856-256-4000\n\u00a92026 Rowan University. Consumer Disclosures | Legal Notices | University Catalog\nRead the Notice of Availability of Rowan\u2019s Annual Security & Fire Safety Report", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://engineering.rowan.edu/programs/chemical/graduate/#main"], ["News", "https://today.rowan.edu/index.html"], ["Alumni", "https://www.alumni.rowan.edu/s/1653/02-alumni/start.aspx?gid=2&pgid=61"], ["Parents", "https://sites.rowan.edu/parentsfamily/index.html"], ["Donors", "https://sites.rowan.edu/advancement/index.html"], ["Jobs", "https://jobs.rowan